{"title":"2004 CEMC Hypatia Problems/Problem 1a","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><div id=\"toc\" class=\"toc\" role=\"navigation\" aria-labelledby=\"mw-toc-heading\"><input type=\"checkbox\" role=\"button\" id=\"toctogglecheckbox\" class=\"toctogglecheckbox\" style=\"display:none\" /><div class=\"toctitle\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2 id=\"mw-toc-heading\">Contents</h2><span class=\"toctogglespan\"><label class=\"toctogglelabel\" for=\"toctogglecheckbox\"></label></span></div>\n<ul>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1\"><a href=\"#Problem_1\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">1</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Problem 1</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-1\"><a href=\"#Problem\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">2</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Problem</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-2\"><a href=\"#Solution_1\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">3</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Solution 1</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-3\"><a href=\"#Solution_2\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">4</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Solution 2</span></a></li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem_1\"><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2004_CEMC_Hypatia_Problems/Problem_1\" title=\"2004 CEMC Hypatia Problems/Problem 1\">Problem 1</a></span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2004_CEMC_Hypatia_Problems/Problem_1&amp;action=edit&amp;section=T-1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem 1\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem\">Problem</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2004_CEMC_Hypatia_Problems/Problem_1a&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Find all values of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/6/e/26eeb5258ca5099acf8fe96b2a1049c48c89a5e6.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"12\" height=\"10\" /> which are roots of the equation <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/d/c/edc2a7596b44f243d2617940718a63e31fb07ef7.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x^{2} + 5x + 6 = 0$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"126\" height=\"18\" />.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution_1\">Solution 1</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2004_CEMC_Hypatia_Problems/Problem_1a&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Solution 1\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>We can realize that <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/1/c/41c544263a265ff15498ee45f7392c5f86c6d151.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$2$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/c/d/7cde695f2e4542fd01f860a89189f47a27143b66.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$3$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" /> sum up to <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/9/0/79069377f91364c2f87a64e5f9f562a091c8a6c1.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$5$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" /> and multiply to <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/0/1/601a7806cbfad68196c43a4665871f8c3186802e.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$6$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" />. Thus, we can split the polynomial into:\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/3/6/1365cce0b6d48a3bf2a2fe190c1ab4a35472e6e1.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x^{2} + 2x + 3x + 6 = 0$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"168\" height=\"18\" />\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/b/4/7b4c5e4783e8f6845273aa6ef17773a48b3ff420.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x(x + 2) + 3(x + 2) = 0$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"189\" height=\"20\" />\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/7/3/773365039aa246d10fa180e8934b67737812c4a9.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$(x + 3)(x + 2) = 0$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"147\" height=\"20\" />\n</p><p>From the factored form, we can see that the roots of the polynomial are <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/6/b/56bdb35c682856e5689f49de6aa819a3a51b005d.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\boxed{x = -3}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -8px\" width=\"71\" height=\"26\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/9/9/b99ee7279b0da24460a88cf62e7ea2a72b0da86f.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\boxed{x = -2}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -8px\" width=\"71\" height=\"26\" />\n</p><p>~anabel.disher\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution_2\">Solution 2</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2004_CEMC_Hypatia_Problems/Problem_1a&amp;action=edit&amp;section=3\" title=\"Edit section: Solution 2\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Using the quadratic formula, we have:\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/7/5/a75900f6e7d2d7e57c057faac4817c39c775b490.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x = \\frac{-5 \\pm \\sqrt{5^{2} - 4 \\times 1 \\times 6}}{2 \\times 1} = \\frac{-5 \\pm \\sqrt{25 - 24}}{2}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -15px\" width=\"359\" height=\"44\" />\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/9/3/193edecb777a7b1c7bc59ba4c384a35c8ae5e586.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$=\\frac{-5 \\pm \\sqrt{1}}{2} = \\frac{-5 \\pm 1}{2}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"177\" height=\"43\" />\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/c/7/3c713ca01cf1d58157d04c8c7efec00b0d92e811.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x = \\frac{-5 + 1}{2}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"95\" height=\"38\" /> or <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/b/4/2b4b604b4175f2742dab7e29867b0125d36682cc.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x = \\frac{-5 - 1}{2}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"95\" height=\"38\" />\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/9/f/79ff14058f0d10a979ca95261cf0f1aa8546b5c0.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x = \\frac{-4}{2}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"64\" height=\"38\" /> or <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/f/0/6f0950fbb6ebce092d1bd0d9d737c9f572781fd1.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x = \\frac{-6}{2}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"64\" height=\"38\" />\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/9/9/b99ee7279b0da24460a88cf62e7ea2a72b0da86f.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\boxed{x = -2}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -8px\" width=\"71\" height=\"26\" /> or <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/6/b/56bdb35c682856e5689f49de6aa819a3a51b005d.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\boxed{x = -3}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -8px\" width=\"71\" height=\"26\" />\n</p><p>~anabel.disher\n</p>\n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20261017203844\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: [show‐toc]\nCPU time usage: 0.018 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.029 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 92/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 79/2097152 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 0/2097152 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 3/100\nExpensive parser function count: 0/100\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 3602/5000000 bytes\n-->\n<!--\nTransclusion expansion time report (%,ms,calls,template)\n100.00%    6.077      1 2004_CEMC_Hypatia_Problems/Problem_1\n100.00%    6.077      1 -total\n-->\n\n<!-- Saved in parser cache with key wiki-wiki_:pcache:35652:|#|:idhash:canonical and timestamp 20261017203844 and revision id 278121. Rendering was triggered because: api-parse\n -->\n</div>"}